GDzpqxDQo1-KilJlPE6Bbj4OE9BCzCJQ4nVtsFQtKvGGttieycYOJl00sbmWv98MPdxbRRz0iplL6Pt70ITrHAegklaLRHN9pgAXwYncW8-TxrjdkfkC0Gn7ctHHuz4hVTdwTbfBSrPULPHXcA9plerVUGBJHqp9anmrt83PKW5PEZJ\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Determining Current Date**\\n\\nI need to clarify the current date and timezone since it's unclear. I might need to get the current time, but there's no tool for that. The user says “tomorrow,” so I wonder if the tool dataset is based on the system date, which isn't given explicitly. I could check a calendar list or use a parallel query, but there's no mention of a specific date in the current context. It’s a bit tricky without direct information!\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Querying Calendar for Date**\\n\\nI’m considering querying a broad calendar listing for dates like 2025, although that feels a bit risky. Since the system doesn't provide the current date, I can think about using a range from January 1, 2025, to January 1, 2027. If I search for current events, I might be able to find tomorrow's date in the summaries. However, I should probably ask the user for the exact date or timezone since they have specific tasks in mind. That makes sense!\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_0adb8fbddeda0dcb016af127ac6e8087d0b57f0ae79877187f\",\"call_id\":\"call_bns2oCxPk0bVfThF0JUw7KKK\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget Dana\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_0adb8fbddeda0dcb016af127ac6e9887d08249e1371ab487ae\",\"call_id\":\"call_DO5B8b0W3NUNf3VuoMTL97oL\",\"name\":\"drive\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"search\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget spreadsheet\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_bns2oCxPk0bVfThF0JUw7KKK\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_7d5871f2070a447f\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_4ccd44181ace41a9\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_DO5B8b0W3NUNf3VuoMTL97oL\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"file_3aa392a762064076\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Q3 Budget\\\",\\n      \\\"mime_type\\\": \\\"application/vnd.google-apps.spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-08T17:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_by\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\",\\n      \\\"native_type\\\": \\\"spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"web_url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be02-cd99-75da-a5e3-4a373144fa46\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
          },
