ail, and now I need to handle an upcoming event on November 10, 2026. I want to figure out the timezone for the calendar because it could vary. The tool needs the from/to offsets in UTC. I should consider looking at the email thread to draft a reply and determine the event details. I might set up a parallel task to check the calendar for that day while reading the email.\"}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.done\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0adb8fbddeda0dcb016af127ada6ac87d0963ed72c57f91921\",\"output_index\":0,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Organizing event details**\\n\\nI just sent an email, and now I need to handle an upcoming event on November 10, 2026. I want to figure out the timezone for the calendar because it could vary. The tool needs the from/to offsets in UTC. I should consider looking at the email thread to draft a reply and determine the event details. I might set up a parallel task to check the calendar for that day while reading the email.\"},\"sequence_number\":89,\"summary_index\":0}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"rs_0adb8fbddeda0dcb016af127ada6ac87d0963ed72c57f91921\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8SewYLcAP_UAGT03LceOMDDyWz4CAe027SMCSLnsoBP2Wbp04yrkYiURajdgpmXJi0hEeOONiIrpM5BBR6cqtbA8gwQ4hHYHF20g-Zx8ZkWxt2ySUXL-hGiwgqIMH5A76dWc4V27avryeW5T7JdLQeMdqD9d7IAzugJ4ORC8WHRMGXpwner2XNoWLp5T57VZA14zW-t7lnZULOpmh4UxcclJ1oJ7Gv97wscEk6vdrh4YTgps2vBowyDAK_GM8uep320JeX7fGkKaPPfWAEDvmjltF4zqGgezsttJ-t75i_c4_eWaI74U2hiFVPL2Xdilbd5Awhl6taka51LPX8W_LnQ9lyqEfgqVusWvnT9wu_JwmkDgBO4e_MoexMLgmi9eZDZk4u_Ft-BXN1PhMNVV0ximHZMv6Th_qeAoFNFYHJq8Pe0WHQfaZoniUwsJTKVkG5yWcmpW7LPPQhIxtxaLYx9wSWXkw3UgYAC0B6qHUDtSQtbJbuKmDnhnTLRQLAxrkYfxJdHriNYBLPAgWCfsLto4f3h2rAkEyn5_mtcsWRaEDh0UZqHtaDTWkORhyWemnzqW3nbJbO4vCtUrvJuDleITPDOjz2GuvGOjQvxKJpFwy2HeDVNO-RG3AgF3JjNzDTo7pmkN1DRr00VkOKIy2Mwc3ldH4ZPAYu0t7Bgp6v