\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (times in UTC), you have:\\n- **Team standup:** 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review:** 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes—Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review, specifically mentioning the Q3 travel line. I found the **Q3 Budget** spreadsheet: [Open the sheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\n\\nI drafted a reply to Dana saying you’ll bring it and included the sheet link. **It hasn’t been sent.**\"},\"sequence_number\":233}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"msg_0adb8fbddeda0dcb016af127b6952087d098d80261250becca\",\"type\":\"message\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (times in UTC), you have:\\n- **Team standup:** 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review:** 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes—Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review, specifically mentioning the Q3 travel line. I found the **Q3 Budget** spreadsheet: [Open the sheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\n\\nI drafted a reply to Dana saying you’ll bring it and included the sheet link. **It hasn’t been sent.**\"}],\"phase\":\"final_answer\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":234}\n\nevent: response.completed\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.completed\",\"response\":{\"id\":\"resp_0adb8fbddeda0dcb016af127b3cc6087d0a742edb4da1cad06\",\"object\":\"response\",\"created_at\":1794189235,\"status\":\"completed\",\"access_programs\":null,\"background\":false,\"completed_at\":1794189238,\"error\":null,\"frequency_penalty\":0.0,\"image\":{\"context_compression\":\"disabled\"},\"incomplete_details\":null,\"instructions\":null,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"max_tool_calls\":null,\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"moderation\":null,\"output\":[{\"id\":\"rs_0adb